# home-telemetry — Pi on home wifi, joined to tailnet, publishing health to MQTT.
# Demonstrates the full remote-diagnostic stack: core baseline + tailscale
# reachability + boot-report (offline diagnostic dump) + mqtt-telemetry
# (live health publishing). No app payload (no mpv, no video) — this is
# the minimum useful "deployed Pi" shape.

core
tailscale
home-wifi
boot-report
mqtt-telemetry
